{"transcript":[{"speaker_id":"speaker_1","start_ms":434,"end_ms":3924,"text":"— Ты придёшь на заседание?— Да.— А Васик?— Нет.— Почему?—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_1","start_ms":5884,"end_ms":6404,"text":"А Музе?—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_2","start_ms":6924,"end_ms":7724,"text":"Ну, придёт, наверное.—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_1","start_ms":8964,"end_ms":12044,"text":"Наверное, и точно.— Хорошо. А мелку будет?—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_2","start_ms":13404,"end_ms":13444,"text":"Нет.—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_1","start_ms":14244,"end_ms":14964,"text":"Ты уверен?—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_2","start_ms":15444,"end_ms":15804,"text":"Да, конечно.—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_1","start_ms":16404,"end_ms":17204,"text":"Тогда начинай.—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_2","start_ms":18044,"end_ms":18084,"text":"Хорошо.—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_1","start_ms":19084,"end_ms":19924,"text":"Нет, опаздывай.—"},{"speaker_id":"speaker_2","start_ms":20524,"end_ms":20764,"text":"Не буду."}]}